NarraStream-Bench includes code adapted from third-party projects.

- `narrastream_bench/third_party/raft/` contains RAFT runtime code under
  BSD-3-Clause terms.
- `narrastream_bench/third_party/amt/` contains AMT runtime code under
  Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 terms.
- `narrastream_bench/third_party/languagebind/` contains LanguageBind runtime
  code. See its bundled license.
- `narrastream_bench/third_party/vtss/` contains VTSS inference code adapted
  from IVEBench.
- `narrastream_bench/third_party/dino_vit.py` is adapted from DINO.
- `narrastream_bench/utils/video_primitives.py` includes helpers adapted from
  VBench.

External model checkpoints are not bundled with this repository. Users must
download them separately and comply with the upstream licenses.
